---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
title="Naveen Rajan — You saw me on DHDL"
description="You saw the window-cleaning drone on Die Höhle Der Löwen. Follow the technical story behind what we built, what went wrong, and what comes next."
>

<main> <section class="hero"> <div class="hero-content"> <p class="eyebrow">NAVEEN RAJAN · ENGINEER & FOUNDER</p>
    <h1>
      You saw the drone<br />
      <span>fail on DHDL.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Here's what you didn't see.
    </p>

    <p class="body">
      I'm the engineer behind Clearbee.
    </p>

    <p class="body">
      The demo didn't go the way we wanted. But getting a robot to
      autonomously clean windows is an unsurprisingly hard engineering
      problem; the technology behind is more interesting.
    </p>

    <p class="body">
      I'm documenting what we built, what broke, what we learned, and
      what comes next.
    </p>

    <a href="#newsletter" class="cta">
      Follow the story <span>→</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-image">
    <img
      src="/images/me-1.jpg"
      alt="Naveen Rajan"
      class="portrait"
    />
  </div>
</section>

<section class="what-youll-get">
  <div class="section-label">WHAT I'LL SHARE</div>

  <div class="topics">
    <div class="topic">
      <span>01</span>
      <p>How 300g drone actually navigates without many sensors</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic">
      <span>02</span>
      <p>Why the Shark Tank demo failed</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic">
      <span>03</span>
      <p>The engineering problems we ran into</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic">
      <span>04</span>
      <p>What we learned - and what we're building next</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="newsletter" id="newsletter">
  <div class="section-label">FOLLOW THE BUILD</div>

  <div class="newsletter-content">
    <h2>
      Get the story<br />
      <span>behind the scenes.</span>
    </h2>

    <p>
      Occasional emails about the technology, experiments, failures,
      and whatever comes next.
    </p>

    <form class="signup-form">
      <input
        type="email"
        name="email"
        placeholder="Your email address"
        aria-label="Your email address"
        required
      />
      <button type="submit">
        Subscribe <span>→</span>
      </button>
    </form>

    <small>No spam. Just the interesting stuff.</small>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <span>NAVEEN RAJAN</span>

  <div class="footer-links">
    <a href="https://github.com/navrjn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      GitHub
    </a>
    <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      LinkedIn
    </a>
    <a href="mailto:hello@navrjn.com">
      Email
    </a>
  </div>
</footer>

</main> </Layout>
<style> main { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; } .hero { min-height: 82vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; align-items: center; gap: 70px; padding: 70px 40px 100px; } .eyebrow, .section-label { color: #666; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; font-weight: 600; } h1 { margin: 28px 0 24px; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 78px); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.055em; font-weight: 650; } h1 span { color: #777; } .intro { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #ddd; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; } .body { max-width: 570px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #999; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; } .hero-image { position: relative; } .portrait { display: block; width: 100%; height: min(70vh, 680px); object-fit: cover; object-position: center; } .cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 24px; padding: 14px 20px; background: #fff; color: #000; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease; } .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #ddd; } .cta span { font-size: 17px; } .what-youll-get { border-top: 1px solid #222; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; padding: 32px 40px 45px; } .topics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); margin-top: 35px; } .topic { display: flex; gap: 25px; padding: 25px 20px 25px 0; border-top: 1px solid #222; } .topic span { color: #555; font-size: 12px; } .topic p { max-width: 380px; margin: 0; color: #ccc; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; } .newsletter { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr; gap: 80px; padding: 120px 40px; } .newsletter-content h2 { margin: 0 0 25px; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.05em; } .newsletter-content h2 span { color: #777; } .newsletter-content > p { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 0 28px; color: #888; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; } .signup-form { display: flex; max-width: 560px; } .signup-form input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; padding: 16px 18px; border: 1px solid #333; border-right: 0; outline: none; background: #111; color: #fff; font: inherit; } .signup-form input::placeholder { color: #555; } .signup-form input:focus { border-color: #666; } .signup-form button { padding: 16px 20px; border: 0; background: #fff; color: #000; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; } .signup-form button:hover { background: #ddd; } .signup-form button span { margin-left: 6px; } .newsletter-content small { display: block; margin-top: 12px; color: #555; font-size: 12px; } footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 30px 40px 50px; border-top: 1px solid #222; color: #555; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; } .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; } .footer-links a { color: #666; letter-spacing: normal; text-decoration: none; } .footer-links a:hover { color: #fff; } @media (max-width: 750px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 45px; min-height: auto; padding: 60px 24px 80px; } .hero-image { order: -1; } .portrait { height: 55vh; max-height: 500px; } h1 { font-size: clamp(44px, 13vw, 64px); } .what-youll-get { padding: 28px 24px 35px; } .topics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .topic { padding-right: 0; } .newsletter { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; padding: 80px 24px; } .signup-form { flex-direction: column; } .signup-form input { border-right: 1px solid #333; border-bottom: 0; } .signup-form button { padding: 15px; } footer { padding: 25px 24px 40px; gap: 20px; flex-direction: column; } .footer-links { gap: 18px; } } </style>